# DINO-X val prediction dumps and the fused Astra+DINO-X test dump: large and
# regenerable (docs/plans/dinox-pro-2026-10.md, "Prediction files"). Only the
# DINO-X test dumps that back published numbers are committed.
benchmarks/basketball/results/vlm/dinox_*_valid.json
benchmarks/basketball/results/vlm/fusion/*dinox*_test.json
benchmarks/basketball/results/vlm/trex_*_valid.json
benchmarks/basketball/results/vlm/llmdet_valid.json
benchmarks/basketball/results/vlm/owlv2*_valid.json

